From 6be0f25ede3342fe9f5dc224d38f48f4c87183dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 22:27:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 425/638] [AROS] Monitor AROSTCP network changes

Replace the generic NOTIMPLEMENTED fallback with an asynchronous AROS notifier that fingerprints real AROSTCP interfaces and DNS configuration. Poll blocking socket-library queries off-sequence and notify Chromium observers only when the captured state changes.



